# GLO > ZOOM KNOB (YES / NO): NO = a turned knob shows no zoom, only the cell highlighted. Default YES.
wait 300
tap FX
tap SEL
expect view 11
turn K2 10 80
shot zoom_yes.png
wait 3000
# GLO: rows (headers skipped): CLOCK OUT, NOTES OUT, 3 x MIDI CH, OUT LOUD, USB, KEY LED, KEY SOUND, THEME, ZOOM KNOB = 9 steps down
tap GLO   # wip290: 1st press = VEL
tap GLO
tap GLO   # (wip124: the 1st press is the mixer, the 2nd the settings list)
shot zoom_glo.png
turn SELECT 9
shot zoom_row.png
turn ALGO -1
shot zoom_row_no.png
tap GLO
wait 300
tap SEL
expect view 11
turn K2 10 80
shot zoom_no.png
wait 3000
